{"name":"Cowhide","hex":"#92484a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cowhide","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A hide of a cow.","Any quantity of hides of cows."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To flog with a cowhide."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cowhide"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cowhide","blocks":[{"text":"Cowhide is the natural, unbleached skin and hair of a cow. It retains the original coloring of the animal. Cowhides are a product of the food industry from cattle. Cowhide is frequently processed into leather."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Cowhide_fur_skin_in_a_furrier%27s_shop%2C_2011.jpg/330px-Cowhide_fur_skin_in_a_furrier%27s_shop%2C_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowhide"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/ConstitutionalCourtofSouthAfrica-table-20070412.jpg/500px-ConstitutionalCourtofSouthAfrica-table-20070412.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/ConstitutionalCourtofSouthAfrica-table-20070412.jpg/500px-ConstitutionalCourtofSouthAfrica-table-20070412.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Nguni Cowhide, The judges' table in a courtroom of the Constitutional Court of South Africa","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AConstitutionalCourtofSouthAfrica-table-20070412.jpg"}],"sounds":{"cowhide":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-cowhide.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-cowhide.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-cowhide.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis